WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.016
HAILEE STEINFELD
In our new series, Hawkeye,

00:00:02.067 --> 00:00:03.958
Jeremy and I both
play expert archers.

00:00:04.008 --> 00:00:04.911
JEREMY RENNER
And while we're not

00:00:04.961 --> 00:00:08.000
expert archers in real life,
we do happen to be expert wrappers.

00:00:08.051 --> 00:00:09.809
HAILEE STEINFELD
Not that kind of rapper.

00:00:09.859 --> 00:00:11.341
JEREMY RENNER
Yeah, expert gift wrappers.

00:00:11.391 --> 00:00:13.245
HAILEE STEINFELD
Yes. And right now, we're going to compete

00:00:13.295 --> 00:00:15.748
to see who can do a
better job wrapping a Christmas present.

00:00:16.037 --> 00:00:16.962
JEREMY RENNER
Let's do this.

00:00:19.232 --> 00:00:20.341
Watch and learn.

00:00:21.029 --> 00:00:22.510
I don't need this.

00:00:23.959 --> 00:00:25.221
- Oh, I got it.
- This is pretty good.

00:00:25.772 --> 00:00:27.139
- You alright?
- That little stamp.

00:00:28.334 --> 00:00:29.326
JEREMY RENNER
Some tape.

00:00:30.091 --> 00:00:31.325
- Alright.
- Okay.

00:00:31.381 --> 00:00:32.833
JEREMY RENNER
Are you ready? Wait, hold on a second.

00:00:39.967 --> 00:00:41.967
Okay. Merry Christmas.

00:00:42.376 --> 00:00:44.717
HAILEE STEINFELD
Wow! Call it a draw?

00:00:44.767 --> 00:00:46.365
JEREMY RENNER
Well, whatever's inside is broken anyway,

00:00:46.415 --> 00:00:47.803
so, what are you gonna do...

00:00:47.853 --> 00:00:50.295
- It's the outside that counts. Right?
- Just the box. Okay.

00:00:50.345 --> 00:00:52.345
HAILEE STEINFELD
Perfect. It's the outside that counts.

